{"4329940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beards vs. Claws", "steam_appid": 4329940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beards vs. Claws is a fun, chaotic first-person sandbox shooter set in a fully destructible world environment where the battlefield is never static, and every match reshapes the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully destructible sandbox where the map changes with every decision. Dig, build, and destroy to adapt the battlefield to your strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329940/extras/1209ab911505120e0cf219552780f1a0.poster.avif?t=1787172159\" width=800 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329940/extras/1209ab911505120e0cf219552780f1a0.webm?t=1787172159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329940/extras/1209ab911505120e0cf219552780f1a0.mp4?t=1787172159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in the world can be destroyed, mined, or built upon in real time - from the ground below to the walls and towers above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig tunnels to flank your enemies, carve out trenches for cover, or build bridges and platforms to gain the high ground. The terrain is a tool, a weapon, and a strategy all at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As players fight, dig, and build, the environment is constantly reshaped by rocket explosions, bridges and newly carved tunnels throughout the map.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329940/extras/8198fdf7483d8f962598c2d6fd70b10b.poster.avif?t=1787172159\" width=800 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329940/extras/8198fdf7483d8f962598c2d6fd70b10b.webm?t=1787172159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329940/extras/8198fdf7483d8f962598c2d6fd70b10b.mp4?t=1787172159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into fast-paced multiplayer matches with friends, or play solo against bots. Beards vs. Claws offers a variety of classic and sandbox-style gamemodes, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gem Rush - dig towards, capture, and recover precious underground gems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deathmatch (free for all)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Deathmatch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shifting Hill - a moving variant of King of the Hill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King of the Hill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the Flag</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox - no limits, cheats enabled, do whatever you want</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want competitive chaos or pure experimentation, there’s a mode to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329940/extras/ac4b92f98231efb0c99ad8c50efc7fc7.poster.avif?t=1787172159\" width=1170 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329940/extras/ac4b92f98231efb0c99ad8c50efc7fc7.webm?t=1787172159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329940/extras/ac4b92f98231efb0c99ad8c50efc7fc7.mp4?t=1787172159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level in Beards vs. Claws is created using the official built-in level editor - which is also freely available to all players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own custom maps, experiment with terrain and layouts, and share your creations with the Steam Workshop community. Play maps made by other players to keep the experience fresh and unpredictable.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beards vs. Claws is a fun, chaotic first-person sandbox shooter set in a fully destructible world environment where the battlefield is never static, and every match reshapes the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully destructible sandbox where the map changes with every decision. Dig, build, and destroy to adapt the battlefield to your strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329940/extras/1209ab911505120e0cf219552780f1a0.poster.avif?t=1787172159\" width=800 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329940/extras/1209ab911505120e0cf219552780f1a0.webm?t=1787172159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329940/extras/1209ab911505120e0cf219552780f1a0.mp4?t=1787172159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in the world can be destroyed, mined, or built upon in real time - from the ground below to the walls and towers above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig tunnels to flank your enemies, carve out trenches for cover, or build bridges and platforms to gain the high ground. The terrain is a tool, a weapon, and a strategy all at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As players fight, dig, and build, the environment is constantly reshaped by rocket explosions, bridges and newly carved tunnels throughout the map.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329940/extras/8198fdf7483d8f962598c2d6fd70b10b.poster.avif?t=1787172159\" width=800 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329940/extras/8198fdf7483d8f962598c2d6fd70b10b.webm?t=1787172159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329940/extras/8198fdf7483d8f962598c2d6fd70b10b.mp4?t=1787172159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into fast-paced multiplayer matches with friends, or play solo against bots. Beards vs. Claws offers a variety of classic and sandbox-style gamemodes, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gem Rush - dig towards, capture, and recover precious underground gems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deathmatch (free for all)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Deathmatch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shifting Hill - a moving variant of King of the Hill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King of the Hill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the Flag</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox - no limits, cheats enabled, do whatever you want</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want competitive chaos or pure experimentation, there’s a mode to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329940/extras/ac4b92f98231efb0c99ad8c50efc7fc7.poster.avif?t=1787172159\" width=1170 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329940/extras/ac4b92f98231efb0c99ad8c50efc7fc7.webm?t=1787172159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329940/extras/ac4b92f98231efb0c99ad8c50efc7fc7.mp4?t=1787172159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level in Beards vs. Claws is created using the official built-in level editor - which is also freely available to all players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own custom maps, experiment with terrain and layouts, and share your creations with the Steam Workshop community. Play maps made by other players to keep the experience fresh and unpredictable.</p>", "short_description": "Dig tunnels, build bridges, and blast your way through walls towards victory in this highly dynamic arena first-person shooter - every obstacle is a potential door", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329940/ae148c8872899ef103347817b6594883dc83d847/header.jpg?t=1787172159", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329940/bb80b8e0cddb02d0cffc517464eea8db9f49ad86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787172159", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329940/bb80b8e0cddb02d0cffc517464eea8db9f49ad86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787172159", "website": "https://www.zerobyter.net/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 / AMD RX 470<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Low-end GPUs may experience brief stuttering when level geometry is recalculated.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></l